kai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/433", "sentence": ["…になった方八十三人、一五・六％ですよ。極めて高い罹患率。この人たちを乗客と一緒にやっぱり守るべきの措置、ここは、ここは反省だと改めて思うんで…"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/435", "sentence": ["…、そうした乗員と二月十九日の下船ぎりぎりまで生活支援を受けて触れた可能性がある、それは感染リスクが乗客としては否定できないんじゃないですか。"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/437", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/439", "sentence": ["○蓮舫君クルーズ船の乗客降ろすこともそうなんですけれども、そういうのって全部議事録とか取っていますか。省内の会議とか大臣に上げた決裁を得るも…"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/441", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/443", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/445", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/447", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/449", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/451", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/456", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/458", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/460", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/462", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/467", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/469", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/473", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/478", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/480", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120115261X00420200302/482", "sentence": []}]}]}]